  "limitations": [
    "Not a cycle, TDM, native UPLI, PHY, CRC or complete transaction RTL model.",
    "No arbitrary Read length/masks, Multi-Beat/Single-Beat interleaving, cache compression, authentication, DataError/Poison, ordinary error statuses beyond0/3, Write/Atomic/INC or management.",
    "No Link Down/reset/timeout/Isolation or epoch model. A stale wire response after legal Tag reuse cannot be distinguished by Tag alone; no such guarantee is claimed.",
    "No complete byte-store/coherence semantics or asynchronous/duplicate memory service completion model.",
    "Field decode does not prove full Control packing, TL credit sequencing, or independent interoperability. Open A05/A06/A09/A19/A21 remain open."
